# Wrath Remix's prologue (STORY.md), played by CI as a new Timerunner (auth_check.py script, on the
# Remix realm): the opening (a tavern in their capital, the war's last battle, what the Lich King's
# reign cost), then the Infinite Bazaar one thing at a time: Eternus and the plan, Alurmi, the class
# instructor and lesson, the Bazaar's keepers, the anomalies, a purchase from the Bronze vendors,
# and Eternus sending the Timerunner to Valiance Keep. The anomalies are killed with a game
# master's `.damage` (the character's blows, so it gets the kills).

cmd .remix
expect chapter 0 (the prologue)

# The opening (RemixIntro.cpp): drinking with friends in the Gilded Rose, until the room stops and
# Moratari walks in; the Broken Front in Icecrown, beside Tirion against the Scourge, until the Lich
# King comes and time stops; the Wrathgate, Wintergarde and Icecrown's fields; then the Bazaar. Each
# act opens from the dark once the game has settled behind the realm's curtain (this client answers
# a curtain at once; the realm holds it a second and a half at least), so its moments are waited for.
wait 8
cmd .gps
expect Stormwind City
# (in their chair at the table with their friends, between the toasts: the curtain lifts about 4 s
# after the login and the talk starts 2.5 s later; they stand for the toast at +9 s and sit again
# at +16 s, until the next toast at +44 s)
wait 21
cmd .remix intro status
expect seated
# (the curtain was drawn three times, the login's, the way to the tavern's and the arrival's, and
# this client answered each: the realm heard "settled" three times)
cmd .remix intro status
expect settled 3
until I'm sorry, hero. I need you. 100
wait 14
cmd .gps
expect Icecrown
until Frostmourne hungers 110
wait 14
cmd .gps
expect Dragonblight
until Farmers and miners 70
cmd .gps
expect Dragonblight
until Arise minions 80
cmd .gps
expect Icecrown
until We can stop all of this 90
wait 5
cmd .gps
expect Malykriss: The Vile Hold

# The starter kit and the class's abilities, a moment after the first login (the client checks
# what the realm wrote down at the end).
wait 3

# Moratari's Hourglass is in the bags from the first moment; turned at the Bazaar before the
# Timerunner has come to it from anywhere, it has nowhere to take them back to.
cmd .remix hourglass
expect Wrath Remix hourglass: bag 255
use-hourglass
expect come here from nowhere yet

# WRM-010, Out of Time: Moratari, a few steps from where the Timerunner arrives, sends them to
# Eternus (Eternus is large, and she stands clear of her).
go 571 6387.5 1872.0 509.1
talk 770001
expect quest 77010
accept 770001 77010
go 571 6391.5 1873.5 509.1
reward 770002 77010
expect rewarded 77010

# WRM-011, The Plan: Eternus answers what she wants, how it is done and why them.
talk 770002
expect quest 77011
accept 770002 77011
talk 770002
expect What do you want from me
select 770002 What do you want
expect credit 77011 770049
select 770002 How is this
expect credit 77011 770050
select 770002 Why me
expect credit 77011 770058
reward 770002 77011
expect rewarded 77011

# WRM-012, Time's Toll: to Alurmi, at the head of the market.
talk 770002
expect quest 77012
accept 770002 77012
go 571 6380.0 1896.5 509.1
reward 770005 77012
expect rewarded 77012

# WRM-020, Old Habits: Alurmi sends the Timerunner to their class's instructor; another class's has
# nothing for a warrior.
talk 770005
expect quest 77020
accept 770005 77020
go 571 6352.0 1843.0 509.1
talk 770110
expect-not quest 77020
go 571 6373.0 1840.5 509.1
reward 770101 77020
expect rewarded 77020

# The warrior's lesson (RemixLessons.cpp), from the same instructor: Charge, Rend and Heroic Strike
# on one of the training yard's dummies.
talk 770101
expect quest 77031
accept 770101 77031
go 571 6368.0 1848.0 509.1 4.71
cast 100 770087
expect credit 77031 770067
# (and in reach of it for the next two)
go 571 6368.0 1838.0 509.0 4.71
cast 772 770087
expect credit 77031 770068
cast 78 770087
expect credit 77031 770069
reward 770101 77031
expect rewarded 77031
talk 770101
expect-not quest 77031

# WRM-021, The Bazaar's Keepers: Zephyr, Sa'at and the Chronologist, then Moratari (the hearthstone
# remembers the Bazaar).
go 571 6387.5 1872.0 509.1
talk 770001
expect quest 77021
accept 770001 77021
go 571 6400.5 1840.0 509.1
talk 770006
expect credit 77021 770006
# Report Time Anomaly, from the game's menu or the toolbar's Help button (the app's add-on): the
# realm writes a report of the quest the Timerunner is on, who they've spoken to since they took it
# and the way they came, for the app to send to GitHub (the server test reads it). What they wrote
# comes in pieces when it's long ("report+" for each but the last).
addon WowRemix report+ CI's report,
addon WowRemix report  from the Bazaar
expect Time anomaly reported
go 571 6388.0 1824.5 509.1
talk 770007
expect credit 77021 770007
go 571 6408.0 1894.0 509.1
talk 770008
expect credit 77021 770008
go 571 6387.5 1872.0 509.1
reward 770001 77021
expect rewarded 77021

# WRM-013, A Small Demonstration: Moratari lets the anomalies through, one at a time (each one
# killed brings the next, three in all).
talk 770001
accept 770001 77013
talk 770001
expect Let the anomalies through
select 770001 anomalies
expect through the seams
# (a moment for each to come through)
wait 2
kill 770031
expect credit 77013 770032 1/3
wait 2
kill 770031
expect credit 77013 770032 2/3
wait 2
kill 770031
expect credit 77013 770032 3/3
wait 2
cmd .remix guid 770031
expect no creature 770031
reward 770001 77013
expect rewarded 77013

# Alurmi, and from her vendor window a heirloom the warrior's kit hasn't got, for 300 Bronze
# (ItemExtendedCost 7708). (How much Bronze the Timerunner has by now isn't checked: the prologue
# gives plenty, and more is better.)
go 571 6380.0 1896.5 509.1
talk 770005
expect Bronze
select 770005 Heirlooms
expect ware 42985 cost 7708
buy 770005 42985
expect bought 42985

# The Bazaar's other Bronze vendors, as a warrior sees them: Hemet Nesingwary's mounts by the
# waystation, Pythagorus's heroic tier sets in the north row (a warrior's pieces, not a mage's), and
# Durus's legendary at the market lane's end, paid for with Bronze a game master gives.
go 571 6413.5 1822.0 509.1
talk 770212
expect Mounts of Northrend
select 770212 Mounts of Northrend
expect ware 50818 cost 7726
go 571 6424.5 1888.0 509.1
talk 770206
expect Tier 10, Icecrown Citadel (25 heroic)
select 770206 Tier 10, Icecrown Citadel (25 heroic)
expect ware 51227
talk 770206
select 770206 Tier 10, Icecrown Citadel (25 heroic)
expect-not ware 51280
go 571 6335.5 1896.0 509.1
talk 770205
expect Legendaries
cmd .remix bronze add 20000
talk 770205
select 770205 Legendaries
buy 770205 46017
expect bought 46017

# WRM-014, To the Front: Moratari's, answered by Eternus, who sends the Timerunner to Valiance Keep,
# before Recruitment Officer Blythe and Enlistment Day.
go 571 6387.5 1872.0 509.1
talk 770001
expect quest 77014
accept 770001 77014
go 571 6391.5 1873.5 509.1
reward 770002 77014
expect rewarded 77014
wait 3
cmd .remix
expect chapter 1
talk 25307
expect quest 11672

# Moratari's Hourglass: from Valiance Keep to the Bazaar, and back to Valiance Keep.
use-hourglass
wait 2
cmd .gps
expect Malykriss: The Vile Hold
cmd .remix hourglass
expect way back map 571 at 229
use-hourglass
wait 2
cmd .gps
expect Borean Tundra

# Borean Tundra's creatures at Chapter I's levels, and squished: three quarters of the health of
# their level.
cmd .remix band
expect band: Borean Tundra
cmd .remix band
expect at 75% of their level's health
